              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Two crew armed with thrusting spear, shield and light armour riding in a four-horse heavy chariot with driver. One crewman has a bow. May have an extra crewman adding +1 Attacks (+5 pts per chariot). Archer may have darts (siltabi, count as javelins), kept in quivers at the front of the chariot (+2 pts). Archers do not suffer -1 to hit for shooting on the move. (Armies of Antiquity p.11)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
