              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All armed with spears, bow, light armour and barding. Models in a unit can have different weapon combinations. Archers in the second rank may shoot at full effect as long as the unit does not move. 0-1 unit. (Armies of Antiquity p.11)</characteristic>
